&lt;h2 data-usually-unique-id=&quot;044234883370604133046166&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zqz90zkz74zz76zeez80zz68zz89zz88zvqz86zuxlz73zexxz80zz73z6d6z72zz79zsz77z&quot;&gt;Compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Canada Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$128,400&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$173,700 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Role Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc6z85zz66zz85z6z86zwfrz65zz69zz80zshuz70z7z69zz89z6k3z122zlrz75z&quot;&gt;Dropbox is entering an exciting new chapter in how we support, retain, and grow our customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc6z85zz66zz85z6z86zwfrz65zz69zz80zshuz70z7z69zz89z6k3z122zlrz75z&quot;&gt;As part of our evolving go-to-market strategy, Customer Experience &amp;amp; Success&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc6z85zz66zz85z6z86zwfrz65zz69zz80zshuz70z7z69zz89z6k3z122zlrz75z h-lparen&quot;&gt;(CXS)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc6z85zz66zz85z6z86zwfrz65zz69zz80zshuz70z7z69zz89z6k3z122zlrz75z&quot;&gt; will assume ownership of commercial renewals, creating a unique opportunity to rethink how we drive customer retention and long-term recurring revenue. We&#39;re looking for an experienced strategy and operations leader to help shape Dropbox&#39;s retention strategy, modernize our renewal operating model, and build the capabilities that enable customers to realize ongoing value from Dropbox.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc6z85zz66zz85z6z86zwfrz65zz69zz80zshuz70z7z69zz89z6k3z122zlrz75z&quot;&gt;As the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc6z85zz66zz85z6z86zwfrz65zz69zz80zshuz70z7z69zz89z6k3z122zlrz75z&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Renewals Strategy Principal Program Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc6z85zz66zz85z6z86zwfrz65zz69zz80zshuz70z7z69zz89z6k3z122zlrz75z&quot;&gt;, you&#39;ll lead the strategy, operating model, and execution behind this transformation. You&#39;ll partner closely with Customer Success, Sales, Revenue Operations, Finance, Product, Legal, and Engineering to develop retention strategies, design scalable programs, and build the playbooks, operating rhythms, and automation that enable Customer Success to successfully own a significant renewal business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc6z85zz66zz85z6z86zwfrz65zz69zz80zshuz70z7z69zz89z6k3z122zlrz75z&quot;&gt;This is a builder role for someone who thrives in ambiguity, enjoys designing scalable business capabilities, and is passionate about leveraging AI, automation, and data to improve customer retention and operational excellence. You&#39;ll identify new opportunities to reduce churn, increase customer engagement, simplify workflows, and drive measurable business outcomes while helping establish Customer Success as a world-class retention organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc6z85zz66zz85z6z86zwfrz65zz69zz80zshuz70z7z69zz89z6k3z122zlrz75z&quot;&gt;Over time, you&#39;ll help shape Dropbox&#39;s long-term customer lifecycle strategy, evolving our approach to customer retention across direct, channel, and self-serve motions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc6z85zz66zz85z6z86zwfrz65zz69zz80zshuz70z7z69zz89z6k3z122zlrz75z&quot;&gt;Lead Dropbox&#39;s retention strategy for commercial customers, identifying opportunities to improve customer outcomes and recurring revenue.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc6z85zz66zz85z6z86zwfrz65zz69zz80zshuz70z7z69zz89z6k3z122zlrz75z&quot;&gt;Develop scalable retention programs, renewal strategies, and customer lifecycle initiatives that increase customer health, product adoption, and renewal rates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc6z85zz66zz85z6z86zwfrz65zz69zz80zshuz70z7z69zz89z6k3z122zlrz75z&quot;&gt;Partner with Customer Success and Sales leadership to evolve the renewal operating model as Customer Success assumes ownership of commercial renewals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc6z85zz66zz85z6z86zwfrz65zz69zz80zshuz70z7z69zz89z6k3z122zlrz75z&quot;&gt;Design playbooks, operating rhythms, and best practices that enable Customer Success to proactively identify and mitigate renewal risk.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc6z85zz66zz85z6z86zwfrz65zz69zz80zshuz70z7z69zz89z6k3z122zlrz75z&quot;&gt;Identify opportunities to leverage AI, automation, and technology to improve customer engagement, reduce manual work, and increase operational efficiency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc6z85zz66zz85z6z86zwfrz65zz69zz80zshuz70z7z69zz89z6k3z122zlrz75z&quot;&gt;Partner with Product, Sales, Revenue Operations, Finance, Legal, and Engineering to improve the end-to-end customer renewal experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc6z85zz66zz85z6z86zwfrz65zz69zz80zshuz70z7z69zz89z6k3z122zlrz75z&quot;&gt;Establish data-driven frameworks for renewal forecasting, customer health, retention analytics, and executive reporting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc6z85zz66zz85z6z86zwfrz65zz69zz80zshuz70z7z69zz89z6k3z122zlrz75z&quot;&gt;Analyze customer behavior and renewal performance to identify trends, recommend strategic investments, and continuously improve retention outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc6z85zz66zz85z6z86zwfrz65zz69zz80zshuz70z7z69zz89z6k3z122zlrz75z&quot;&gt;Lead cross-functional initiatives that improve customer lifecycle management and drive long-term recurring revenue growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc6z85zz66zz85z6z86zwfrz65zz69zz80zshuz70z7z69zz89z6k3z122zlrz75z&quot;&gt;Influence senior leaders across the business to align on customer retention priorities and operational improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8z68zmz76zz72zz72zz82zz86z8z79ze08fz74z4xz88z0kaz67zvg7z70z5rz81zu&quot;&gt;10+ years of experience in SaaS strategy, renewals, customer lifecycle management, customer success, revenue operations, or commercial operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8z68zmz76zz72zz72zz82zz86z8z79ze08fz74z4xz88z0kaz67zvg7z70z5rz81zu&quot;&gt;Experience designing, building, or scaling renewal, retention, or recurring revenue programs within a B2B SaaS environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8z68zmz76zz72zz72zz82zz86z8z79ze08fz74z4xz88z0kaz67zvg7z70z5rz81zu&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in renewal strategy, forecasting, customer retention, and recurring revenue operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8z68zmz76zz72zz72zz82zz86z8z79ze08fz74z4xz88z0kaz67zvg7z70z5rz81zu&quot;&gt;Experience building scalable operating models, processes, playbooks, governance, or customer programs that improved business performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8z68zmz76zz72zz72zz82zz86z8z79ze08fz74z4xz88z0kaz67zvg7z70z5rz81zu&quot;&gt;Experience leading new initiatives or organizational transformations from concept through operational execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8z68zmz76zz72zz72zz82zz86z8z79ze08fz74z4xz88z0kaz67zvg7z70z5rz81zu&quot;&gt;Proven ability to lead complex cross-functional programs and influence senior stakeholders without direct authority.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8z68zmz76zz72zz72zz82zz86z8z79ze08fz74z4xz88z0kaz67zvg7z70z5rz81zu&quot;&gt;Strong strategic thinking with a demonstrated ability to translate strategy into operational execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8z68zmz76zz72zz72zz82zz86z8z79ze08fz74z4xz88z0kaz67zvg7z70z5rz81zu&quot;&gt;Excellent executive communication and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8z68zmz76zz72zz72zz82zz86z8z79ze08fz74z4xz88z0kaz67zvg7z70z5rz81zu&quot;&gt;Strong analytical skills with experience using data to drive operational decisions, prioritize investments, and measure business outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8z68zmz76zz72zz72zz82zz86z8z79ze08fz74z4xz88z0kaz67zvg7z70z5rz81zu&quot;&gt;Experience working within or alongside Customer Success organizations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8z68zmz76zz72zz72zz82zz86z8z79ze08fz74z4xz88z0kaz67zvg7z70z5rz81zu&quot;&gt;Experience supporting multi-product SaaS portfolios&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8z68zmz76zz72zz72zz82zz86z8z79ze08fz74z4xz88z0kaz67zvg7z70z5rz81zu&quot;&gt;Experience implementing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-675351272183230986808083 author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8z68zmz76zz72zz72zz82zz86z8z79ze08fz74z4xz88z0kaz67zvg7z70z5rz81zu&quot;&gt;renewal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8z68zmz76zz72zz72zz82zz86z8z79ze08fz74z4xz88z0kaz67zvg7z70z5rz81zu&quot;&gt; and retention playbooks or lifecycle revenue frameworks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
