&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84z5u1z69zz90zlz73z3ly1nz76zw1r5kz89zz66z4z65zz65zjz122zf092&quot;&gt;To learn more about why these skills matter and what the data shows about thriving through change, read this&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;attrlink url author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84z5u1z69zz90zlz73z3ly1nz76zw1r5kz89zz66z4z65zz65zjz122zf092&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;attrlink&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dropbox.jobs/en/our-blog/employee-stories/the-era-of-durable-skills-what-the-data-tells-us-about-thriving-in-change/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-target-href=&quot;https://www.dropbox.jobs/en/our-blog/employee-stories/the-era-of-durable-skills-what-the-data-tells-us-about-thriving-in-change/&quot;&gt;blog post&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84z5u1z69zz90zlz73z3ly1nz76zw1r5kz89zz66z4z65zz65zjz122zf092&quot;&gt; our Chief People Officer, Melanie Rosenwasser.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-usually-unique-id=&quot;044234883370604133046166&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zqz90zkz74zz76zeez80zz68zz89zz88zvqz86zuxlz73zexxz80zz73z6d6z72zz79zsz77z&quot;&gt;Compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Role Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;Dropbox is hiring an Account-Based Marketing Manager to help turn our highest-potential accounts into our next great customer relationships. As part of the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86ztu9wz70z0bz81zz77zz83zy9z83zxuidcz75zkz77zz85zxez68zz75zf5z73z&quot;&gt;Dropbox&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt; Marketing organization, you will create targeted, personalized marketing programs that engage priority buying groups, open doors within strategic accounts, and create or accelerate pipeline across the Dropbox portfolio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on IC4 individual contributor role for a high-agency marketer who combines strong campaign execution with analytical judgment, strategic prioritization, and cross-functional influence. You will work at the intersection of Marketing, Sales, and Data Science, translating account intelligence, product signals, buyer needs, and business priorities into compelling experiences that move accounts forward. You will independently lead cross-functional, multi-phase ABM initiatives, clarify ambiguous problems, make thoughtful tradeoffs, and help partners align around the highest-value opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;This role is built for an experimenter and builder. You will have the freedom to test new channels, messages, technologies, and account plays, learn quickly from performance, and scale the approaches that deliver results. You will help Dropbox strengthen its ABM motion by bringing together personalized experiences, product-led growth signals, and coordinated Sales engagement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;You will join Dropbox at an important moment in the evolution of our sales-led growth strategy. You will gain meaningful exposure to senior Sales and Marketing leaders, work across a diverse portfolio of products and audiences, and see a direct connection between your ideas, the customer experiences you create, and measurable revenue impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;ABM campaign execution: D&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;evelop and execute integrated 1:1, 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;:few&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;1:many &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;programs &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;with Marketing leadership &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;that engage priority accounts, reach key buying-group members, generate qualified meetings, and create or accelerate pipeline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;Creative &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;ccount &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;lays: Design high-impact campaigns and bespoke experiences that help Dropbox stand out within target accounts, using tactics such as personalized content, digital advertising, direct mail, events, executive engagement, custom landing pages, and coordinated Sales outreach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;Account &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;ersonalization: Turn account fit, product usage, intent, engagement, industry context, and buyer insights into relevant messaging, offers, content, and experiences tailored to specific accounts and buying roles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;Sales partnership &amp;amp; prioritization: Partner closely with Sales to identify priority accounts and stakeholders, establish shared investment criteria, understand account-specific challenges, and align teams around the highest-value opportunities. Develop coordinated plays that open new opportunities, expand customer relationships, advance active deals, and resolve misalignment when account priorities or signals change.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;Experimentation &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;&amp;amp; o&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;ptimization: Develop campaign hypotheses, test new channels and creative approaches, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;prepare&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt; account engagement and pipeline results&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt; to review and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;continuously improve targeting, messaging, personalization, and program investment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;AI-enabled execution: Proactively apply approved AI tools to improve account research, campaign development, personalization, analysis, and decision-making. Model rigorous validation of AI outputs in complex marketing scenarios, identify and mitigate risks, and experiment responsibly with new AI-enabled approaches that can improve outcomes for the role and its cross-functional partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;Scalable plays &amp;amp; operating model: Turn successful campaigns and experiments into repeatable frameworks, templates, measurement approaches, and playbooks that Sales and Marketing teams can consistently adopt across products and segments. Use learnings from execution to recommend improvements to Dropbox’s ABM priorities, operating approach, and cross-functional ways of working.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz82zfwz66zwhdz68zz78zz74zl2vz70z03z66zz80zrz77zt56z90zz81zz74zz69zpz80zkf&quot;&gt;Results driven professional with 6+ years of overall experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;BM&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;xperience: 4+ years of B2B marketing experience, including at least 2 years directly executing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;ABM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt; programs for enterprise or high-value accounts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;Scaled, high-agency execution: Experience independently owning ABM programs in a complex B2B environment involving multiple buying-group members, cross-functional Sales coordination, multiple channels, and measurable pipeline outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;Multi-channel campaigns: Demonstrated experience independently launching coordinated campaigns across channels such as digital advertising, email, landing pages, content, direct mail, events, executive programs, and Sales outreach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;Writing &amp;amp; messaging: Excellent writing and editing skills, with experience developing high-converting landing pages, emails, ads, campaign messaging, or Sales-facing assets tailored to specific accounts and buyer audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;Analytics &amp;amp; insights: Excellent analytical ability, including experience interpreting account, campaign, intent, engagement, and pipeline data to uncover findings, identify opportunities, prioritize action, and recommend program changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;Sales &amp;amp; revenue execution: Experience partnering directly with Sales to select accounts, map buying groups, coordinate outreach, and execute programs tied to qualified meetings, pipeline creation, opportunity progression, or account expansion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;Experimentation, optimization &amp;amp; AI: Demonstrated experience forming campaign hypotheses, running structured tests, and applying learnings to improve targeting, messaging, personalization, channel mix, and campaign results. Experience using generative AI to improve marketing workflows while rigorously validating outputs, identifying risks or limitations, protecting sensitive data, and maintaining accountability for final quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;Market experience: Background in supporting complex GTM motions for AI, collaboration, or productivity products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;Signal-based targeting: Experience using product usage, intent, propensity, engagement, or other account signals to prioritize audiences and personalize campaigns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;AI-enabled marketing: Experience using AI tools to accelerate account research, messaging, personalization, campaign development, or performance analysis while maintaining accuracy and brand quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;High-velocity execution: Demonstrated ability to manage multiple campaigns simultaneously, prioritize effectively across competing deadlines, and quickly pivot resources and plans toward emerging opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvotr820z71zcz89zz71zz69zz85zw5ol1z74zz85zfboz89zz87zp2oz75z1z69z&quot;&gt;PLG-to-SLG motions: Experience supporting product-led-to-sales-led growth motions by using product and account signals to prioritize high-potential customers, activate targeted campaigns, and drive enterprise conversion or expansion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Durable Skills&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;AI fluency means using these tools to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;amplify&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt; human judgment, not replace it. We believe people with these skills will thrive as work and technology&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;continue to evolve:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Awareness:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;U&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;nderstand &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;yourself&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt; and others&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Judgment:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;E&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;valuat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt; information and mak&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;e &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;decisions in complex situations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;L&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;earn, adjust, and stay effective through change&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connection:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;ommunicat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;, collaborat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;, and build trust&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84z5u1z69zz90zlz73z3ly1nz76zw1r5kz89zz66z4z65zz65zjz122zf092&quot;&gt;To learn more about why these skills matter and what the data shows about thriving through change, read this&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;attrlink url author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84z5u1z69zz90zlz73z3ly1nz76zw1r5kz89zz66z4z65zz65zjz122zf092&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;attrlink&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dropbox.jobs/en/our-blog/employee-stories/the-era-of-durable-skills-what-the-data-tells-us-about-thriving-in-change/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-target-href=&quot;https://www.dropbox.jobs/en/our-blog/employee-stories/the-era-of-durable-skills-what-the-data-tells-us-about-thriving-in-change/&quot;&gt;blog post&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84z5u1z69zz90zlz73z3ly1nz76zw1r5kz89zz66z4z65zz65zjz122zf092&quot;&gt; our Chief People Officer, Melanie Rosenwasser.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-usually-unique-id=&quot;044234883370604133046166&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zqz90zkz74zz76zeez80zz68zz89zz88zvqz86zuxlz73zexxz80zz73z6d6z72zz79zsz77z&quot;&gt;Compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;US Zone 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;This role is not available in Zone 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Zone 2&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$142,300&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$192,500 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Zone 3&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$126,500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$171,100 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Role Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Dropbox is seeking an experienced, strategic, and technology-forward Senior Director, Global Tax Reporting to lead the Company’s worldwide direct tax reporting function. This leader will be responsible for all aspects of global income tax accounting, reporting, and compliance, ensuring accurate financial reporting, strong governance, and operational excellence across U.S. federal, state, and international jurisdictions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;As a key member of the Tax leadership team, the Senior Director will oversee the quarterly and annual income tax provision under ASC 740, global income tax compliance, SEC tax reporting, tax accounting for strategic business initiatives, and the Company’s overall direct tax reporting framework.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Beyond technical expertise, this leader will shape the long-term strategy of the Global Tax Reporting organization by driving innovation, embedding AI and automation into the function, developing exceptional talent, and building scalable processes that support Dropbox’s evolving business. Success in this role requires technical excellence, strategic and anticipatory thinking, operational rigor, transparent collaboration, and inspirational leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strategic Tax Leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Develop and execute a multi-year vision and strategy for the Global Tax Reporting organization that aligns with Dropbox’s broader Tax, Finance, and Company priorities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Demonstrate strategic and anticipatory thinking by identifying emerging tax, regulatory, business, and technology trends and positioning the organization ahead of future risks and opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Build the operating model and organizational capabilities required to support Dropbox’s evolving business and global tax landscape.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Lead and develop a high-performing team by establishing clear priorities, accountability, succession plans, and meaningful career development opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Foster an AI-first culture of innovation and continuous improvement by embracing new technologies, simplifying processes, and empowering the team to challenge traditional ways of working.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Build trusted, transparent partnerships across Finance and the business by collaborating effectively across functions, proactively identifying and escalating risks, and translating complex tax matters into clear, actionable recommendations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Global Tax Accounting &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Serve as Dropbox’s technical tax accounting leader, providing guidance on complex business initiatives, evolving tax laws, and accounting developments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Lead the worldwide quarterly and annual income tax provision under ASC 740.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Own all current and deferred tax accounting, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent2 list-bullet2&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Effective tax rate analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Deferred tax assets and liabilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Valuation allowance analyses&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Uncertain tax positions under ASC 740-10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Return-to-provision analyses&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Prepare and review all tax-related financial statement disclosures for Forms 10-Q, 10-K, earnings releases, and other SEC filings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Partner closely with Accounting and other Finance teams to ensure a timely and accurate financial close and reporting process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Evaluate the tax accounting impact of new tax legislation, accounting standards, regulatory developments, and business initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Global Income Tax Compliance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Lead Dropbox’s worldwide direct tax compliance function, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent2 list-bullet2&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;U.S. federal income tax&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;State and local income taxes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Foreign income tax filings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Estimated tax payments and extensions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Tax account reconciliations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Oversee external service providers while maintaining accountability for quality, accuracy, and timeliness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Drive continuous improvement across compliance processes, governance, documentation, and execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Ensure compliance activities are scalable, efficient, and aligned with Dropbox’s global operating model.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;AI, Automation &amp;amp; Digital Transformation&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz69z2z90zdz79zpu9z76zz77z4z87z2mz73zz81zz88zz89zmuz87zbugiz80zuon&quot;&gt;Lead the transformation of the Global Tax Reporting organization by embedding AI, automation, and digital technologies into everyday work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
